### V16 Pipeline Flow
```
Step -7: GROUND TRUTH CHECK (V16 - MANDATORY FIRST)
  ground-truth-cli.py stats → predict (if sufficient data)
  IF CALIBRATED: prediction overrides template advice
  IF INSUFFICIENT: flag output, offer to record decision
  ALWAYS: check pending outcomes, alert if overdue

Step -6: Ecosystem Mapping + Causal Reasoning (V13)
  ecosystem-mapper-runner → ecosystem-mapper agent → causal-chain-builder → causal-reasoner agent
  Filter: only positions with durability_score >= 6 pass to Step -5
  Kill: CROWD positions flagged, TREND positions killed
Step -5A: Observation Layer (V12)
  ad-library-observer → arbitrage-detector → compound-customer-scorer
  → (optional) ad-creative-analyzer, amazon-trend-observer
Step -5B: Survivor Intelligence (V12)
  trade-data-connector → failure-survivor-analyzer → business-model-matrix
  CRITICAL: trade data >$100M → cannot kill product, evaluate per-model
Step -4: Evidence Discovery (V11)
  evidence-scraper → path-extractor → pattern-clusterer → scoring
Step -3: Load Intelligence (V10)
Step -2: Media Detection (V9)
Step -1: Multi-Lens Decomposition (V9 + V11 + V12)
Step 0+: Scanner (V12 trade-data-informed) → Deep-reasoner (14 techniques)
  → staircase-gate → Execution Path Generator → Learning Loop

Step +1: GROUND TRUTH CAPTURE (V16 - POST-DECISION)
  AFTER any recommendation with action:
  ground-truth-cli.py record --json '{decision context}'
  SET outcome_due_date (default 30 days)
  ADD to pending_outcomes.json
```

